"text": "The take changes the layout every boot runs, so the windowed stand's boot smoke is listed (`role = 'smoke'`, `env = ['WAYLAND_DISPLAY']`, its binary built by the fast leg's workspace tests) beside the agent-run contract's `boot` and `run stand`. - No live leg runs in this chunk. - The `wasm` leg needs the `wasm32-unknown-unknown` target on the host's stable toolchain. It was added for the P3   reading and stands. - The audit leg runs locally before the push (security-plan · decision/local-audit-before-push). - Every `git diff` reads against the commit this chunk starts from, `0dba5035b0ef2eb29538ad05a3bd112d9f44f318`. - The per-OS matrix is read on the pushed run's own CI jobs (the `ci.py` entry). `coverage` and the WPT suites are   not run locally: CI runs `coverage`, and WPT is report-only on the fork (test-plan · decision/wpt-conformance-report-only)."
}
],
